// The recordings the mod's file carries (sound.h, SoundCarried). Paths are from the project's folder, where build.bat
// runs. SOUND_CREDITS.md says whose each recording is and under which licence.
// BLOWOFF: a turbo's blow-off valve. FLUTTER: a turbo's flutter.
BLOWOFF RCDATA "assets\\blowoff.wav"
FLUTTER RCDATA "assets\\flutter.wav"
